Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.80,0:00:06.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.49,0:00:07.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}castiello.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.04,0:00:08.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是侍奉主的天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}i'm an angel of the lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.15,0:01:43.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}anna?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.99,0:01:46.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道你在哪儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}do you know where you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.70,0:01:58.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道你为什么在这儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}do you know why you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.39,0:01:59.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还记得你做过什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}do you remember what you did?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.60,0:02:09.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}i...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.53,0:02:12.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想设法警告他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}i was trying to warn them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.96,0:02:15.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,警告谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}warn who?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.16,0:02:16.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.39,0:02:20.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,忘了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.73,0:02:22.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这听来了很傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.23,0:02:26.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想警告他们的是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what were you trying to warn them about?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.56,0:02:32.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}look...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.83,0:02:34.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}i get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.36,0:02:35.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认为我是疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you think i'm nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.26,0:02:39.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我是你  我也会认为我疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}if i were you,i'd think i was nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.99,0:02:42.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我所说的都是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's all true.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.56,0:02:46.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没关系的  你可以告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's okay. you can tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.96,0:02:48.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我洗耳恭听\N{\fnArial\fs30}i'm here to listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.73,0:02:53.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,世界末日\N{\fnArial\fs30}the end...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.43,0:02:55.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就要来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}is coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.06,0:02:57.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天启\N{\fnArial\fs30}the apocalypse.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.93,0:02:59.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天启\N{\fnArial\fs30}the apocalypse.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.43,0:03:01.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是圣经里所讲的\N{\fnArial\fs30}like in the bible?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.99,0:03:04.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}kind of.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.36,0:03:07.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的意思是  最终的结果都是一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}i mean,same bottom line.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.63,0:03:11.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一个恶魔  叫莉莉丝的\N{\fnArial\fs30}this demon,lilith,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.19,0:03:13.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要打破66个封印\N{\fnArial\fs30}is trying to break the 66 seals
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.70,0:03:15.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,解放被禁锢在地狱的路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}to free lucifer from hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.36,0:03:17.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}lucifer...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.36,0:03:19.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将会带着天启降临\N{\fnArial\fs30}will bring the apocalypse.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.39,0:03:24.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}so...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.16,0:03:27.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果抓住它们就得马上干掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}smoke 'em if you got 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.93,0:03:39.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}anna?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.39,0:03:44.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.53,0:03:46.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚刚在干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}what were you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.83,0:03:48.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.03,0:03:52.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是在聆听\N{\fnArial\fs30}just listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.36,0:03:54.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么  你刚才所说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}so,you were saying
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.43,0:03:57.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这个世界上有66个封印\N{\fnArial\fs30}that there are,uh,66 of these seals in the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.43,0:03:59.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}no. no.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.39,0:04:02.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是有差不多6000个封印\N{\fnArial\fs30}there are about 6,000 possible seals,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.56,0:04:05.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而莉莉丝只是要破坏其中的66个\N{\fnArial\fs30}and lilith only has to break 66 of them,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.23,0:04:08.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且没有人知道她是要破坏哪66个封印\N{\fnArial\fs30}and no one knows which 66 she's gonna break.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.36,0:04:09.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}i see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.39,0:04:17.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是无法阻止她的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's why it's nearly impossible to stop her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.39,0:04:21.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也是天使会失败的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that's why the angels are losing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.16,0:04:26.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是我们为什么都要灭亡的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's why we're all gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.16,0:04:31.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本德医生请到神经科\N{\fnArial\fs30}dr. bender to the mental ward,please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.60,0:04:33.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本德医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}dr. bender.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.63,0:04:35.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,服药时间到了  安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}time for your meds,anna.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.89,0:04:39.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}anna
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.25,0:04:45.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么呢  美女\N{\fnArial\fs30}what's the matter,sweetie?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.27,0:04:49.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的脸  你的脸怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}your face --what happened to your face?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.50,0:04:53.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}i know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.16,0:04:56.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我帅到让你想亲我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}i'm downright kissable.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.46,0:05:33.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,布莱恩  拜托  伙计  再来一次就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}brian,come on,man,just one more.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.33,0:05:35.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至  至少给我一次反败为胜的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}just -- just give me a chance to win it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.70,0:05:36.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正是你的钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's your cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.80,0:05:38.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打扰下\N{\fnArial\fs30}excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.73,0:05:40.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我弟弟有点喝醉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}my brother's a little sauced to be making bets.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.86,0:05:42.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  他自己要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}hey. he insisted.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.16,0:05:43.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  钱你已经到手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}yeah,but you've already taken,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.86,0:05:45.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么  你想再洗劫他一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}what,two bills off him?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.26,0:05:46.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚刚说过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}i'm just saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.50,0:05:47.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  收声  迪恩  我很清醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}hey,shut up,dean.i'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.86,0:05:50.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  你一点都不清醒  你醉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}no,you're not fine.you're drunk!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.26,0:05:52.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们赌500元\N{\fnArial\fs30}let's make it $500.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.93,0:05:53.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,500元\N{\fnArial\fs30}$500?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.90,0:05:54.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.86,0:05:57.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,500元\N{\fnArial\fs30}$500.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.83,0:05:59.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来开局\N{\fnArial\fs30}your break.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.09,0:06:18.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}keep the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.66,0:06:21.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}keep the money?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.93,0:06:24.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}what --
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.70,0:06:34.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不错  你可真是无处不在啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}well,you got a lot of nerve showing up anywhere near me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.14,0:06:35.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是来告诉你们一些信息  说完我就离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}i just have some info and then i'm gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.03,0:06:37.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.70,0:06:39.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我收到一些小道消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}i'm hearing a few whispers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.10,0:06:41.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦  真好  恶魔的小道消息  那一定很可靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}ooh,great,demon whisperers --that's reliable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.93,0:06:42.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个叫安娜·米尔顿的姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}girl named anna milton
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.99,0:06:44.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨晚从一个反锁的房间逃走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}escaped from a locked ward yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.86,0:06:46.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恶魔们都十分积极地想要找到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}the demons seem pretty keen on finding her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.80,0:06:48.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,似乎  还有些重要人物都现身了\N{\fnArial\fs30}apparently,some real heavy hitters turned out
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.86,0:06:50.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就为了追捕这个复活节彩蛋[指安娜]\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the easter-egg hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.09,0:06:51.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-为什么  她是什么人物  -不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}-why? who is she? - No idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.99,0:06:53.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我认为她一定很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}but i'm thinking that she's important,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.86,0:06:55.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为追捕的要求是她得是活的\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause the order is to capture her alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.19,0:06:59.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得不管这个交易是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}i just figured that whatever the deal is,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.16,0:07:01.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必须在恶魔之前找到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}you might want to find this girl before the demons do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.50,0:07:05.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  也许我们应该去查一查\N{\fnArial\fs30}look,maybe we should check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.60,0:07:09.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-事实上  我们已经有案子在查了  不过还是谢谢你  -什么案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}-actually,we're working a case,but thanks.-what case?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.50,0:07:12.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-嗯  我们已经有头绪了  很大的突破  -听来了真是恐怖啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}-uh,we've got leads,big leads.-sounds dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.90,0:07:15.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  追着几个婊子可不会让我们徒劳无获\N{\fnArial\fs30}yeah,well,it sure ain't goosechasing after some chick
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.13,0:07:16.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁来着  据我们了解  那根本就不存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}who,for all we know,doesn't even exist,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.86,0:07:18.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仅仅就因为你说她很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}just because you say she's important.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.63,0:07:19.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是来告诉你们这个消息的\N{\fnArial\fs30}i'm just delivering the news.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.76,0:07:21.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们要怎么做是你们的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can do whatever you want with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.20,0:07:23.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就我而言  我已经告诉你们了  我的任务就完成了\N{\fnArial\fs30}far as i'm concerned,i told you,i'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.43,0:07:26.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  等等  安娜逃出来的那家医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}wait,wait,wait. this hospital anna escaped from --
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.46,0:07:28.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叫啥名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}it got a name?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.80,0:07:35.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能拿一份失踪人口报告吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}can i get a copy of the missing-persons report?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.70,0:07:38.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了  好吧  谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}great. okay. thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.30,0:07:41.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安娜·米尔顿是真有其人\N{\fnArial\fs30}well,anna milton's definitely real.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.56,0:07:43.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并不意味着这件案件也是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't mean the case is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.43,0:07:45.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去那家医院要三日车程\N{\fnArial\fs30}and this hospital's a three-day drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.46,0:07:46.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也差不多到了  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}we've driven further for less,dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.46,0:07:52.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有话就说  尽管说\N{\fnArial\fs30}you got something to say,say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.50,0:07:53.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想说  真他妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}oh,i'm saying it -- this sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.83,0:07:56.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不气吗  我们在追那女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're not pissed we're going after the girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.40,0:07:58.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你很气  露比让我们走这趟  -是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}-you're pissed ruby threw us the tip. -right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.86,0:08:00.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正因为你相当关心她\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause as far as you're concerned,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.46,0:08:02.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事实上地狱里的婊子都是一伙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}the hell-bitch is practically family.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.16,0:08:04.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 伙计  有些事情是注定要发生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}yeah,boy,something major must've happened
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.30,0:08:05.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当我从地狱回来站在阳光普照的大地上时\N{\fnArial\fs30}while i downstairs,'cause i come back,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.03,0:08:07.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不正和\N{\fnArial\fs30}and -- and you're bff with a demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.83,0:08:10.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉你了  迪恩  她来帮我追杀莉莉丝的\N{\fnArial\fs30}i told you,dean,she helped me go after lilith.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.10,0:08:12.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你的描述  非常生动\N{\fnArial\fs30}well,thanks for the thumbnail -- real vivid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.13,0:08:14.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想要更多细节吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you want to fill in a little detail?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.76,0:08:17.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然  迪恩  我们轮流说\N{\fnArial\fs30}sure,dean,let's trade stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.13,0:08:19.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你先说  到底怎么了  别漏了细节\N{\fnArial\fs30}you first. how was hell? don't spare the details.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.66,0:09:13.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出现吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.06,0:09:15.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}where the hell are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.00,0:09:19.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还在想你会不会来\N{\fnArial\fs30}i was wondering whether to come or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.03,0:09:22.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  你杀了我的帮手\N{\fnArial\fs30}i mean,you shot one of my co-workers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.00,0:09:27.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别冲动  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't take this the wrong way,sam,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.63,0:09:29.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是个容易冲动的人  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you don't look so hot,buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.03,0:09:34.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜你并不想烧了你哥哥的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}i guess burying your brother didn't agree with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.73,0:09:43.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}well...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.46,0:09:46.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我先看看你的特制匕首吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}well,let's see that special little knife of yours first.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.13,0:09:55.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都没武器了\N{\fnArial\fs30}no devil's traps,either.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.36,0:09:59.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我到这里不是来玩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}i'm not here to play games.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.60,0:10:05.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我猜猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}well,let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.60,0:10:07.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想做个交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}you want to make a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.33,0:10:13.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放温彻斯特父子离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}and 'round and 'round the winchesters go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.10,0:10:18.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  萨姆  我不会答应的\N{\fnArial\fs30}i'm sorry,sam. that's not gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.81,0:10:28.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想再活十年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}i don't want 10 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.27,0:10:29.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一年也不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}i don't want one year.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.77,0:10:31.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我什么都不想要\N{\fnArial\fs30}i don't want candy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.34,0:10:33.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只想和迪恩换个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}i want to trade places with dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.34,0:10:34.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}no.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.41,0:10:37.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带我走  这很公平\N{\fnArial\fs30}just take me! it's a fair trade!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.57,0:10:38.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.17,0:10:42.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么不\N{\fnArial\fs30}why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.94,0:10:44.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉莉丝要让我死\N{\fnArial\fs30}lilith wants me dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.44,0:10:46.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就让迪恩走  我来成全她\N{\fnArial\fs30}just let dean go,and she can have me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.04,0:10:50.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还不明白吗  萨姆  这和你的灵魂无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't you understand,sam? it's not about your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.54,0:10:52.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩在地狱里  这正是我们想要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}dean's in hell,right where we want him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.91,0:10:55.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一切想要的什么都得到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we've got everything exactly the way we want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.44,0:10:58.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想杀了我吗  杀吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}you want to kill me?! go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.27,0:11:00.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的主人什么都安排好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}i've made peace with my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.97,0:11:23.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在他对安娜逃走的事一点都想不起来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}now,the orderly has no recollection of anna's escape?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.94,0:11:25.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很显然  他被她打晕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}apparently,she knocked him unconscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.04,0:11:27.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,引发了健忘症\N{\fnArial\fs30}the blow caused some amnesia.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.84,0:11:30.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他甚至连走进她房间都忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}he doesn't even remember coming into her room.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.11,0:11:31.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下得真他妈的重手\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's a hell of a right hook
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.47,0:11:33.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她击倒了一个比她重80磅的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}to knock out a guy that's got 80 pounds on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.54,0:11:35.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想她是算好了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}we think she may have planned this,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.64,0:11:37.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-在外面等着吧  -好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}-waited behind the door. -right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.01,0:11:41.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你提到过安娜的病是最近才有的\N{\fnArial\fs30}uh,you mentioned anna's illness was recent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.34,0:11:43.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两个月前  她还好好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}two months ago,she was happy,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.27,0:11:45.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,精神很好  从事新闻业\N{\fnArial\fs30}well-adjusted,journalism major,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.47,0:11:46.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朋友很多  前途无量\N{\fnArial\fs30}lots of friends -- bright future.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.04,0:11:49.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发生什么了  疯了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}so,what happened -- she just...flipped?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.24,0:11:51.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是精神分裂症引起的悲剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}well,that's the tragedy of schizophrenia.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.04,0:11:54.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,几星期之内  安娜因错觉而精神崩溃\N{\fnArial\fs30}within weeks,anna was overtaken by delusions.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.74,0:11:56.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么样的错觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}what kind of delusions?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.24,0:11:59.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我认为恶魔无处不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}she thought demons were everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.41,0:12:02.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}huh. interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.21,0:12:04.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对我们的病人来说并不寻常\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's not uncommon for our patients
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.97,0:12:06.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会相信恶魔是存在的\N{\fnArial\fs30}to believe that monsters are real.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.31,0:12:10.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那  那可真古怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}well,that -- that's just batty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.47,0:12:27.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是《圣经》中的《启示录》\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's revelations.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.37,0:12:28.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当她在画的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}since when does the book of revelations
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.61,0:12:29.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有鬼火缠身吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}have jack-o'-lanterns?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.11,0:12:33.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,额 我们也只了解一点点\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's a,uh,it's a little-known translation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.04,0:12:37.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安娜的父亲是教堂牧师\N{\fnArial\fs30}well,anna's father was a church deacon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.14,0:12:38.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当她病了后\N{\fnArial\fs30}when she became ill,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.54,0:12:41.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她的幻想总带有宗教的色彩\N{\fnArial\fs30}her paranoia took on religious overtones.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.14,0:12:42.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她深信恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}she was convinced the devil
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.61,0:12:46.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会崛起并终结整个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}was about to rise up and end the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.24,0:12:48.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我希望你能找到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}i hope you find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.31,0:12:51.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她这样单独出去很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's dangerous for her to be out there alone right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.91,0:13:08.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能没人\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe they're not home.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.71,0:13:09.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,车都停在车道上\N{\fnArial\fs30}both cars in the driveway.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.27,0:13:25.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,米尔顿夫妇\N{\fnArial\fs30}mr. and mrs. milton?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.77,0:13:28.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是来自治安部的\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're from the sheriff's department.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.87,0:13:32.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只是想来问你们几个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}we just wanted to ask you a couple of questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.00,0:13:58.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,硫磺\N{\fnArial\fs30}sulfur.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.33,0:14:00.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恶魔们在这里袭击我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}the demons beat us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.37,0:14:01.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管和安娜作的是什么交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}whatever the deal is with this anna girl --
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.93,0:14:05.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  他们想要她  他们不是无目的的\N{\fnArial\fs30}yeah,they want her. they're not screwing around.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.26,0:14:08.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  那么我是被隔离的女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}all right,so,i'm "girl,interrupted,"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.39,0:14:10.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道启示录在讲什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}and i know the score of the apocalypse,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.12,0:14:12.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被吓坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}just busted out of the nut-box...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.81,0:14:16.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,顺便用一下超能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}possibly using superpowers,by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.57,0:14:19.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要我去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}where do i go?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.27,0:14:23.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有安娜笔记本里的画\N{\fnArial\fs30}hey,you got those sketches from anna's notebook?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.67,0:14:25.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.07,0:14:26.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}let me see 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.84,0:14:29.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.01,0:14:36.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她画的是教堂的玻璃窗\N{\fnArial\fs30}she was drawing the window of her church.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.87,0:14:38.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一遍又一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}over and over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.01,0:14:40.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你是个虔诚徒  被吓坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you were religious,scared,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.41,0:14:41.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,魔鬼又在缠上你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and had demons on your ass,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.67,0:14:43.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}where would you go to feel safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.24,0:15:14.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.41,0:15:23.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}anna?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.77,0:15:29.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不是来伤害你的  我们是来帮助你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're not gonna hurt you. we're here to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.41,0:15:34.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫萨姆  这是我哥哥 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}my name is sam. this is my brother,dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.34,0:15:36.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.11,0:15:37.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不是萨姆 温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}not sam winchester?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.41,0:15:41.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}uh,yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.87,0:15:47.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.14,0:15:50.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}the dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.97,0:15:56.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}well,yeah.the dean,i guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.70,0:15:58.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's really you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.04,0:16:01.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}oh,my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.74,0:16:03.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天使们讨论过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}the angels talk about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.47,0:16:05.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在地狱的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}you were in hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.54,0:16:06.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但卡西迪奥把你救出地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}but castiel pulled you out,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.87,0:16:08.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,某些天使认为你可以拯救我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and some of them think you can help save us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.07,0:16:13.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有些一直不喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and some of them don't like you at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.90,0:16:16.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们最近一直在说你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}they talk about you all the time lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.27,0:16:18.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我了解你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}i feel like i know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.37,0:16:20.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能和天使说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}so,you talk to angels?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.84,0:16:23.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}oh,no. no,no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.44,0:16:25.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们可能不知道我的存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}um,they probably don't even know i exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.44,0:16:27.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是某些  不小心听到\N{\fnArial\fs30}i just kind of...overhear them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.00,0:16:29.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你偷听到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you overhear them?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.27,0:16:33.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  有时他们在交谈的时候  我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}yeah,they talk,and sometimes i just...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.31,0:16:35.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在脑子里出现他们谈的内容\N{\fnArial\fs30}hear them in my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.57,0:16:38.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比如  现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}like...right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.60,0:16:40.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在没有  但之前有很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}not right this second,but a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.34,0:16:42.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能不去听他们的的话  太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and i can't shut them out,there are so many of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.07,0:16:46.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以他们把你关一群疯子中间\N{\fnArial\fs30}so,they lock you up with a case of the crazies
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.64,0:16:48.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当你正在\N{\fnArial\fs30}when really you were just...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.64,0:16:50.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,收挺天使们的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}tuning in to angel radio?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.31,0:16:53.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.54,0:16:54.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.97,0:16:57.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安娜  你什么时候开始能听到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}anna,when did the voices start?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.51,0:16:58.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还记得么\N{\fnArial\fs30}do you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.74,0:17:01.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,9月18号  我很确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}i can tell you exactly september 18th.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.74,0:17:05.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我从地狱出来的那天\N{\fnArial\fs30}the day i got out of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.70,0:17:09.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我清楚的听到第一个词是\N{\fnArial\fs30}first words i heard,clear as a bell
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.07,0:17:11.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩 温彻斯特得救了\N{\fnArial\fs30}"dean winchester is saved."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.77,0:17:16.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.44,0:17:18.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出乎我的意料\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's above my pay grade,man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.37,0:17:23.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少我们知道恶魔们为什么这样想你死\N{\fnArial\fs30}well,at least now we know why the demons want you so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.24,0:17:24.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们抓到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}they get ahold of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.67,0:17:27.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就能听到敌对方的所有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}they can hear everything the other side's cooking.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.37,0:17:29.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也是个天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're 1-900-angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.51,0:17:36.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我的父母还好么\N{\fnArial\fs30}hey,um,do you know are my parents okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.07,0:17:37.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还没回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}i -- i didn't go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.90,0:17:39.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我当时很害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}i was afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.21,0:17:40.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们找到那个女孩了么\N{\fnArial\fs30}you got the girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.54,0:17:42.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-很好  我们走  -她的脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}good,let's go. oh! her face!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.97,0:17:44.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-没关系  他们来帮我们的  -别太肯定\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's okay.she's here to help. yeah,don't be so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.51,0:17:45.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-赶紧走  -为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have to hurry. why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.64,0:17:46.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为高等级恶魔们都赶来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}because a demon's coming --big-timer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.80,0:17:48.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以晚些再和他们交战 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can fight later,dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.37,0:17:49.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好  简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}well,that's pretty convenient --
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.60,0:17:50.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们找到她的时候才出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}showing up right when we find the girl
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.90,0:17:52.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,充当好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}with some bigwig on your tail?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.54,0:17:54.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是我带他来的  是你  什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}i didn't bring him here.you did.what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.47,0:17:55.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他从你们从这女孩家里出来的时候一直跟踪你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}he followed you from the girl's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.90,0:17:57.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们该走了 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}we got to go now. dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.91,0:18:03.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太迟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.31,0:18:06.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.54,0:18:18.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呆在这里别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}okay. stay in there.don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.94,0:18:23.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不 萨姆  你必须现在把他抓出来  -等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}no,sam,you gotto pull him right away.whoa,hold on a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.61,0:18:26.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在不是探究萨姆黑暗力量的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}now's not the time to bellyache about sam going dark side.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.11,0:18:28.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么做能除去那个恶魔  要么我们死\N{\fnArial\fs30}he does his thing,he exorcises that demon,or we die.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.54,0:19:03.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个手势\N{\fnArial\fs30}that tickles.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.27,0:19:07.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还不够力量和我对抗 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}you don't have the juice to take me on,sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.91,0:19:19.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}hello again,dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.31,0:19:28.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}come on,dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.81,0:19:30.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还没认出我么\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't you recognize me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.61,0:19:33.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我忘记了  那时我是个儿科医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}oh,i forgot i'm wearing a pediatrician.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.54,0:19:38.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们关系很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we were so close...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.17,0:19:40.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在地狱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}in hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.51,0:19:44.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿拉斯泰尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}alastair.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.17,0:19:52.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你该更用点力  孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're gonna have to try a whole lot harder than that,son.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.91,0:20:33.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你快搞完了没\N{\fnArial\fs30}are you almost done?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.31,0:20:35.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我尽快了\N{\fnArial\fs30}i'm going as fast as i can.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.94,0:20:37.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}good,'cause you know
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.64,0:20:39.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的肩膀脱臼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}i got a dislocated shoulder over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.07,0:20:40.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.64,0:20:43.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我缝完了就把帮你把肩膀弄好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll pop it back when I'm finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.61,0:20:54.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把酒给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.71,0:21:04.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么说你把那有魔力的刀弄丢了 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,you lost the magic knife,huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.97,0:21:07.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 为了救你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,saving your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.11,0:21:09.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那恶魔是他妈的谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell was that demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.04,0:21:12.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是什么好鸟\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.51,0:21:14.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们该找到安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to find Anna.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.47,0:21:16.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,露比找到她了 我想她不会有事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ruby's got her I'm sure she's Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.01,0:21:18.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.24,0:21:19.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.81,0:21:24.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,数三下\N{\fnArial\fs30}On three.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.57,0:21:25.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,1...\N{\fnArial\fs30}1...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.74,0:21:38.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就那么相信露比\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure about ruby?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.31,0:21:41.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我觉得她像是有那么点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause i think it's just as likely
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.11,0:21:42.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,利用我们去找那个能听天使说话的女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}she used us to find radio girl
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.77,0:21:44.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后再带着那个恶魔来宰了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then brought that demon in to kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.97,0:21:47.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会的 她带走安娜是要保护安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,she took Anna to keep her safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.51,0:21:51.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.37,0:21:53.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么 她怎么不打电话告诉我们她在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,why hasn't she called to tell us where she is?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.91,0:21:56.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为那个恶魔说不定现在正盯着我们呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because that demon is probably watching us right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.54,0:21:58.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等着再一次跟踪我们找到安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Waiting to follow us right back to Anna again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.97,0:22:00.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是为什么他放我们溜走\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why he let us go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.44,0:22:02.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你管这叫放我们溜走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You call this letting us go?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.47,0:22:04.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.11,0:22:07.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想想吧 要杀我们随时可以动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look,killing us would've been no problem to that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.54,0:22:09.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是为什么现在我们要低调\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why,for now,we just got to lay low
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.81,0:22:11.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等着露比联系我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and wait for Ruby to contact us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.41,0:22:12.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她怎么可能那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's she gonna do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.54,0:22:21.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么就那么相信她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you trust her so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.44,0:22:24.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.17,0:22:29.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你该告诉我更多的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to do better than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.84,0:22:31.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 我可不是想要和你干仗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,and I'm not trying to pick a fight here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.94,0:22:34.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说我真的想理解你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,I really want to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.14,0:22:35.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我需要知道得更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I need to know more.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.77,0:22:38.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说 我应该知道得更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,I deserve to know more.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.31,0:22:43.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.91,0:22:45.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她救了我的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}She saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.11,0:23:28.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你对我那么贴心 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for keeping this warm for me,Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.11,0:23:29.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,露比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ruby.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.07,0:23:33.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎归队\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nice to be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.67,0:23:37.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来的地方比地狱更险恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where I was,even for hell,it was nasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.71,0:23:40.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想我真的把莉莉丝惹毛了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I really pissed lilith off.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.24,0:23:43.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想象我是多么宽心当莉莉丝给我最后一次机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imagine my relief when she gave me one last chance
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.84,0:23:45.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把它拨乱反正\N{\fnArial\fs30}to take it topside.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.51,0:23:48.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我全部要做的就是找到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all I had to do was find you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.77,0:23:50.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宰了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.27,0:23:55.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.44,0:23:56.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,悉听尊便\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.47,0:23:58.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,动手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.57,0:24:11.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿着钥匙 我们该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab your keys.we got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.29,0:24:13.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.89,0:24:27.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道什么听起来最棒么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what sounds good?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.76,0:24:29.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,炸薯条\N{\fnArial\fs30}French fries.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.95,0:24:33.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我饿死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.18,0:24:36.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才爬出地狱 我应该享受一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just escaped hell.I deserve a treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.38,0:24:41.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要知道如果你感谢我我会很开心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know,a "thank you" would be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.82,0:24:43.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁叫你过来帮我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who asked for your help?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.55,0:24:47.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不明白我所经历过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no idea what I've been through.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.15,0:24:50.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当莉莉丝被惹毛了 她就要开始搞你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When lilith gets pissed,she gets creative.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.85,0:24:52.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想听听\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to hear
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.18,0:24:54.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在地狱里看到的惨相吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}about the corners of hell I've seen,Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.89,0:24:56.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不，我不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.32,0:24:58.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要做的是让她相信我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the things I had to do to convince her I was sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.99,0:25:00.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是可以相信的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I could be trusted?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.49,0:25:02.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么 你一定会得到一个超级圣诞大礼包\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,this'll definitely get you a fat Christmas bonus.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.75,0:25:05.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.99,0:25:09.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我逃出来...就为了你 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a fugitive...for you,sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.68,0:25:12.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我历尽艰险回到你身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took all of this risk to get back to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.35,0:25:14.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以 我应该得到他妈的一声谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,yeah,I deserve a damn "thank you."
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.32,0:25:16.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁叫你过来救我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who asked you to save me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.08,0:25:17.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just trying to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.58,0:25:19.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能帮我救救迪恩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you help me save Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.75,0:25:21.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.08,0:25:25.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道有什么人可以强大到救他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing I know of is powerful enough to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.58,0:25:36.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且我对你没有利用价值了\N{\fnArial\fs30}then I have no use for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.28,0:25:38.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么 滚出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.12,0:25:39.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.38,0:25:41.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你附在谁身上 露比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whose body are you riding,Ruby?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.35,0:25:42.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该你什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you care?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.91,0:25:44.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以前从来没问过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've never asked me that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.91,0:25:45.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我现在问你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm asking now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.85,0:25:51.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个小秘书\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some secretary.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.68,0:25:57.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给她自由 萨姆...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let her go. Sam...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.52,0:25:59.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者我直接把你送回地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}or i send you right back to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.88,0:26:09.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好，拔出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}all right,pull it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.08,0:26:32.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我该怎样才能搞点薯条来呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}who do i have to kill to get some french fries around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.01,0:26:59.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,试试看\N{\fnArial\fs30}proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.71,0:27:02.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这哥们真有社会道德意识\N{\fnArial\fs30}this body is 100% socially conscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.88,0:27:03.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很环保的\N{\fnArial\fs30}i recycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.98,0:27:06.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,AL GORE会自豪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}al gore would be proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.75,0:27:13.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不会想让我穿一只破鞋吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}you didn't want me to take a body with someone in it,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.32,0:27:15.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我保证鬼魂已经消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and i made sure that the spirit was gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.98,0:27:19.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,房间空空如也 你很开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}apartment was empty.you happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.52,0:27:22.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么会在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.78,0:27:25.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我无法把迪恩带回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}i can't bring dean back.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.48,0:27:31.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我能给你一些其他你要的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}but i can get you something else that you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.55,0:27:41.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}...what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.01,0:27:43.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}lilith.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.75,0:27:49.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你无论如何都要我用我的邪恶力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}you want me to use my psychic whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.90,0:27:51.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞧 我知道这会有点古怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}look,i know that it spooks you --
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.39,0:27:52.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别说了 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}skip the speech.i'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.25,0:27:55.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.72,0:27:57.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老兄 悠着点\N{\fnArial\fs30}slow down there,cowboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.98,0:27:58.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只管告诉我该做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}just tell me what i have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.32,0:28:08.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,历历史就是个胆小的婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}look,lilith is one scary bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.32,0:28:11.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在地狱时和她聊过\N{\fnArial\fs30}when i was in the pit,there was talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.95,0:28:14.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她正在搞一个大阴谋\N{\fnArial\fs30}she's cooking up something big --
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.18,0:28:15.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,末日天启 \N{\fnArial\fs30}apocalyptic big.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.35,0:28:16.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们该宰了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}so let's kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.68,0:28:18.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还想下去再剩半天命回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}you want to go in there and half-ass it like before?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.88,0:28:22.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时间多的足够可以解决问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have the time to get it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.35,0:28:23.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就着手干吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}let's get it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.32,0:28:25.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说干就干\N{\fnArial\fs30}okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.75,0:28:28.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要我干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}what do you want from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.95,0:28:30.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,耐心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}well,a little patience...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.77,0:28:35.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保持清醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}and sobriety.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.20,0:28:38.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,答应我\N{\fnArial\fs30}promise me that...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.13,0:28:40.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会教授你我知道的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}and i will teach you everything i know.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.23,0:28:46.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}so?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.93,0:28:49.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她教了你什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what'd she teach you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.23,0:28:53.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我学的第一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}well,the first thing i learned...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.50,0:28:58.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真是个蹩脚学生\N{\fnArial\fs30}...i'm a crappy student.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.87,0:30:05.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一点都不好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}not funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.07,0:30:24.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,慢慢来 萨姆 会有起色的\N{\fnArial\fs30}just give it time,sam.it'll get better.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.03,0:30:28.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.87,0:30:31.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道我需要更多的练习\N{\fnArial\fs30}i need more practice?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.40,0:30:33.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是指驱魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}i'm not talking about pulling demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.17,0:30:37.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我理解迪恩的离开对你是\N{\fnArial\fs30}i know losing dean was...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.80,0:30:40.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想提这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}i don't want to talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.83,0:30:47.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.90,0:30:50.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你什么时候开始训斥我来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}where do you get off slapping me
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.47,0:30:53.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用一些像时间会治愈一切的废话来安慰我\N{\fnArial\fs30}with that greeting-card,time-heals crap?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.13,0:30:53.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你他妈的知道什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}what the hell do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.78,0:30:54.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我曾经也是人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}i used to be human.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.81,0:31:00.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道失去亲人时的痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}and i still remember what it feels like to lose someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.91,0:31:04.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}i'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.11,0:31:08.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.81,0:31:14.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}i can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.54,0:31:16.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆 你并不孤单\N{\fnArial\fs30}sam,you're not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.34,0:31:23.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要干吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.50,0:31:24.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆 都会好起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}sam,it's okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.04,0:31:27.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 我没事 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}no,that is anything but okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.91,0:31:30.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.14,0:31:30.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}what's wrong?!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.94,0:31:34.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从哪上手\N{\fnArial\fs30}where do i start?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.64,0:31:41.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不是因为这躯壳\N{\fnArial\fs30}is it because of the body?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.07,0:31:44.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之前我告诉过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}because i told you --
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.14,0:31:46.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还是我 外表不一样而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's all me inside of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.14,0:31:49.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}there is no one else.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.14,0:31:52.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆 我还在 完好无损\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's nice inside this body,sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.27,0:31:58.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如假包换\N{\fnArial\fs30}soft and warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.17,0:32:02.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你干吗呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.21,0:32:04.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗 可你真是给吓坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}isn't it 'cause you're really scared
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.47,0:32:06.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要一个魔鬼一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}to go there with a demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.87,0:32:11.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 是不是有违常理不符合逻辑\N{\fnArial\fs30}because it's wrong and it's bad and we shouldn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.87,0:32:51.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.37,0:32:53.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.41,0:32:55.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说的太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}too much information.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.74,0:32:57.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早告诉过你 我完好无缺\N{\fnArial\fs30}hey,i told you i was coming clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.21,0:32:58.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,话是没错 不过我还是不习惯\N{\fnArial\fs30}yeah,but now i feel dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.54,0:33:03.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得了 你凑合着看看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}okay,well,uh,brain-stabbing imagery aside...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.57,0:33:05.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,目前为止 都符合你所说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}so far,all you've told me about
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.27,0:33:07.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就一傻走狗 你以为自己谁呢 操\N{\fnArial\fs30}is a manipulative bitch who,uh,screwed you,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.64,0:33:08.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对付你还要稍微动动脑子\N{\fnArial\fs30}played mind games with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.97,0:33:11.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后根据书里对你百般顺从并最后推倒你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and did everything in the book to get you to go bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.24,0:33:12.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不错 好戏还在后头\N{\fnArial\fs30}yeah,well,there's more to the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.31,0:33:16.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请\N{\fnArial\fs30}just...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.31,0:33:17.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这么暴露\N{\fnArial\fs30}skip the nudity,please.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.70,0:33:24.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样好多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}pretty soon after...that,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.21,0:33:27.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我组合几个符号\N{\fnArial\fs30}um...i put together some signs...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.80,0:33:28.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是一种征兆\N{\fnArial\fs30}omens.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.91,0:33:30.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,预示着什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}saying what?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.47,0:33:32.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉莉丝来了 \N{\fnArial\fs30}lilith was in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.27,0:33:37.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想先挫挫她的锐气\N{\fnArial\fs30}and i wanted to strike her first.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.61,0:33:40.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你根本就还没有准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're not ready yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.21,0:33:42.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要不就现在  要不永远都不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's now or never.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.44,0:33:44.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我们可以等到你完全准备好了再去\N{\fnArial\fs30}no,we got to wait until you get it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.44,0:33:46.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你之前还没有成功过\N{\fnArial\fs30}you haven't been too successful.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.51,0:33:47.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行了  我会用这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}all right,i'll use this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.77,0:33:48.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,停一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.07,0:33:52.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不能像只无头苍蝇一样乱撞  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can't just fly in there reckless,sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.07,0:33:53.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是要你杀了那个贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}we need you to take the bitch out.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.70,0:33:54.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦  我会杀了她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}oh,i'll take her out all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.57,0:33:57.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你只有一次机会  你就是这一次机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}you get one shot,and you're it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.53,0:34:00.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是唯一个可以办到这一点的  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're the only one who can do it,sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.23,0:34:02.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以如果是她把你先杀死了的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}so if she kills you first...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.11,0:34:08.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}what?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.54,0:34:09.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你根本就不想活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you don't want to survive this.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.84,0:34:11.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-拜托  -这简直就是神风敢死队的自杀式袭击\N{\fnArial\fs30}-come on. -it's a kamikaze attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.84,0:34:13.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是去送死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you want to die fighting lilith.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.97,0:34:14.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,简直是胡扯\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.97,0:34:16.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  那就是事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}no,it's the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.34,0:34:17.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为如果你杀了她而拯救了世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}because if you kill her and you survive this,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.74,0:34:19.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就没有了你哥哥的陪伴不得不孤单的活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}then you have to go on without your brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.96,0:34:21.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这绝对不是迪恩想要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}this isn't what dean would've wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.51,0:34:22.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这绝不是他牺牲了自己想要换来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}this isn't what he died for.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.93,0:34:24.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我让开\N{\fnArial\fs30}get out of my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.84,0:34:27.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}no,sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.20,0:34:28.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是自寻死路\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is suicide!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.51,0:35:44.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求求你  我想要回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}please,i want to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.67,0:35:52.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉莉丝要我转达她的歉意\N{\fnArial\fs30}lilith sends her regrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.07,0:35:54.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她无法守约了\N{\fnArial\fs30}she couldn't make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.37,0:36:05.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带走那个女孩快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}take the girl and run!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.01,0:36:08.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.11,0:36:27.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,露比  你制造了不少麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}ruby,you're in so much trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.91,0:36:30.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会让你  呆在地下室\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're gonna make you...down in the basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.67,0:36:32.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有点东西我们想要让你尝尝\N{\fnArial\fs30}the things we're gonna do to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.24,0:36:58.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.34,0:37:02.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}i'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.11,0:37:06.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.01,0:37:11.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,露比是为了我回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}ruby came back for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.68,0:37:15.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无论你怎么说  她曾经救过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}whatever you have to say,she saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.04,0:37:18.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更重要的是  她了解我\N{\fnArial\fs30}more than that,she got through to me.
